WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:08.700
ONE GO is VIP-50 on your phone. Sign in once with your email and password.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.200
You land on Home: your points and your streak.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.800
Morning Pulse: what is waiting, and where to start.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.900
Under Go To, tap a circle to open its screens. A number means something there is waiting.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Tasks is today's list, never more than fifteen, VIP touches first. The rings show overdue, left today, this week and done.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.400
To do a touch, tap the task.

7
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:54.300
Call, Text or Video text opens your own phone, and you send it. Then tap Done, or move it to Tomorrow or another day.

8
00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:04.900
The Daily Tracker. Each orb is a box you tick: calls, video texts, notes, social, face to face and more.

9
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:14.200
Pulse suggests what to do next, and your points count toward this week's 100 minimum.

10
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Bonus Points are your weekly boxes: mixer and newsletter, drop-bys, face to face, business and growth.

11
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:31.300
Daily points plus bonus points make your weekly score. The minimum is 100.

12
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:40.400
My Week sets your working hours and your best time for calls. Pulse plans your day inside them, ready by 7:00.

13
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:49.700
Commitments sit on Home. Set up to five a week, and tick each one when it's done.

14
00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.500
Some count themselves, like calls. Every-day commitments sit underneath.

15
00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:04.400
The Calendar shows your day: the blocks Pulse planned, and what you already booked.

16
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.900
Tap Looks good to keep the plan.

17
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:17.400
Contacts shows your people in rings: VIP-50 on the inside, VIP-100 around them.

18
00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:26.400
The colour shows this month's touches: green all done, yellow some, red none yet. Pink means a birthday this week.

19
00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:37.700
Hot, Warm and Cold: everyone you are working with, by how soon they could close. Open each one to work it today.

20
00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:47.500
The Business Rolodex keeps the businesses you trust, grouped by kind. Community shows the ones other agents share.

21
00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:55.000
The Referral Network shows referrals sent to you and by you. You send one from ONE MOVE.

22
00:02:55.100 --> 00:03:00.500
Buyer Needs shows what other agents' buyers want, never the buyer's details.

23
00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:08.900
The Drop-By Map is for your quarterly drop-bys. Pick a distance, then tap Plan Route.

24
00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:16.500
Mixer invites. Your text is ready, and it goes from your own number.

25
00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:26.900
Each guest you ticked in ONE MOVE gets their own RSVP link. Tap Text beside a guest to send.

26
00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:36.200
The 90-Day Challenge: five arenas and one daily score. Tap I'm Ready to start your ninety days.

27
00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:44.200
The Lounge is your VIP-50 community. Post a win, a question or an idea.

28
00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.900
The Video Library holds your training, by topic.

29
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.800
VIP-50 Assets holds your resources and your scripts.

30
00:03:53.600 --> 00:04:02.200
Team Leads shows the leads your team lead sends you. Sarah is not on a team, so hers is empty.

31
00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:06.500
Notifications: coaching calls, badges earned and announcements, newest first.

32
00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:12.800
My Profile: your week score, your streak, closings and level.

33
00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:21.100
Below are your goals, your badges, earned never given, and your privacy and settings.

34
00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:28.220
Plan on the desktop. Do it on your phone. That's ONE GO.
